        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>BAL-CHE-TRR, Baldwin Chesapeake Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Chesapeake Front Door Entryset has a very traditional look with its oval shape. It is accented by the round rose for both the interior deadbolt and the interior lever. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, it is built to stand the test of time, even on high-traffic doors like your front door. It has a lifetime manufacture's warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. This Traditional Handleset will fit doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose your favorite of 6 levers or knobs for the interior trim.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection Chesapeake Handleset with Round Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Chesapeake Traditional Oval 3/4 Escutcheon Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 10-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-8/9\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-13/32\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Chesapeake Front Door Entryset with Round Interior Trim, Baldwin CHE-TRR",
                "description": "The Chesapeake Front Door Entryset has a very traditional look with its oval shape. It is accented by the round rose for both the interior deadbolt and the interior lever. As part of Baldwin's Reserve Collection, it is built to stand the test of time, even on high-traffic doors like your front door. It has a lifetime manufacture's warranty and a 25 year finish warranty. This Traditional Handleset will fit doors that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose your favorite of 6 levers or knobs for the interior trim. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n",
                "keywords": "traditional entry sets, classic entry sets, traditional front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, oval handlesets, Chesapeake Oval Handlesets, Chesapeake Front Door Entryset with Round Interior Trim, Baldwin CHE-TRR, BAL-CHE-TRR, Baldwin Chesapeake Traditional Oval 3/4 Escutcheon Entrysets, Baldwin Reserve Collection Chesapeake Handleset with Round Roses,"
